18. In view of the above, appeal merits consideration, in the result the following:
ORDER i) Appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The impugned judgment and award passed by the Tribunal is modified;
- 14 - NC: 2024:KHC:37534 iii) Claim petition against the Insurance company stands dismissed;
iv) The petitioner is at liberty to proceed against the owner of the offending motor cycle/1st respondent to recover the compensation awarded by the Tribunal;
v) Amount in deposit including the statutory deposit shall be return to Insurance Company.

